Animated GRUB
=============

This project uses and modifies GRUB animation code derived from the
a1ive GRUB animation work.

The modified GRUB animation implementation retains its upstream
copyright and licensing notices.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/a1ive/grub

The GRUB-derived source code is licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 (GPLv3). See LICENSE for the full license text.

Project additions include the animation theme, animation frame assets,
validation script, build script, and project documentation.
